Package: zhGebiete
Type: Package
Title: Package for accessing the Gebietsstammdaten API of the Canton of Zürich
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Livio", "Bätscher",
      email = "livio_999@hotmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2989-930X")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an interface to the Gebietsstammdaten API of the
  Statistical Office of the Canton of Zurich. This package allows users to
  retrieve data for geographic units such as municipalities  (Gemeinden), 
  districts (Bezirke), and regions directly from R. It serves as an efficient
  tool for accessing data for analyses and visualizations.
